---
---
<section id="contacto" class="py-20">
  <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12 flex items-center gap-4 text-[var(--color-30)]">
    <span class="opacity-50 text-xl font-mono">03.</span> Contacto
  </h2>
  
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
    <div>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-30)] mb-8 leading-relaxed italic opacity-80">
        ¿Tienes algún proyecto de ingeniería en mente o buscas colaborar en sistemas de control y automatización? Mi bandeja de entrada siempre está abierta.
      </p>
      
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <a href="mailto:guadarrama.augusto@gmail.com" class="flex items-center gap-4 text-[var(--color-30)] hover:text-[var(--color-10)] transition-all group">
          <div class="p-3 border border-[var(--color-30)]/10 bg-[var(--color-30)]/[0.02] rounded-lg group-hover:border-[var(--color-10)]/30 group-hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(34,211,238,0.05)]">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium">guadarrama.augusto@gmail.com</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <form class="space-y-4">
      <div>
        <label for="name" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-30)] opacity-50 mb-2">Nombre</label>
        <input type="text" id="name" class="w-full bg-[var(--color-60)] border border-[var(--color-30)]/20 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-[var(--color-10)]/50 transition-all text-[var(--color-30)] text-sm" placeholder="Tu nombre">
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="email" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-30)] opacity-50 mb-2">Email</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" class="w-full bg-[var(--color-60)] border border-[var(--color-30)]/20 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-[var(--color-10)]/50 transition-all text-[var(--color-30)] text-sm" placeholder="tu@email.com">
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="message" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-30)] opacity-50 mb-2">Mensaje</label>
        <textarea id="message" rows="4" class="w-full bg-[var(--color-60)] border border-[var(--color-30)]/20 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-[var(--color-10)]/50 transition-all text-[var(--color-30)] text-sm" placeholder="¿Cómo puedo ayudarte?"></textarea>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="w-full py-4 bg-[var(--color-10)] text-[var(--color-60)] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-xs rounded-lg hover:brightness-110 transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98] shadow-lg shadow-[var(--color-10)]/10">
        Enviar Mensaje
      </button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
